    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1088">

                <pb facs="1169" n="1073" xml:id="pg1073"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Finch to Mr. Sherman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Montevideo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-02-21"><hi rendition="#italic">February 21,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 17.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the pleasure to transmit herewith a
                    note of condolence from the minister of foreign affairs of the Republic of
                    Uruguay deploring the calamity which befell the American war ship <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Maine</hi>, and expressing sympathy with the United
                    States Government; also a telegram of condolence and sympathy from the minister
                    of foreign affairs for the Republic of Paraguay, referring to the same calamity.
                    I send you translations of both, and also copies of my reply.</p>
                <p>Your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. R. Finch.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d1088-a1.xml" xpointer="d1088-a1"/>
            </div>
